# The wide frame's new chat and its first words sent (newchat.mbt, flight.mbt carried; the web's madeChat.ts
# toMadeChat): the page becomes the chat, the words going up into their bubble.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 新建对话
wait 900
until 做任何事
wait 500
type 把发布说明写一下
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 3000
